codex
The DiD code keeps each payload’s lone and split flags together, then resamples the two regimes independently, as the plan specifies. I also found a mismatch in completeness handling: the plan blocks decisions after an unscored O_diff item, but the code gates the primary row only on P_author. I’m tracing which other labels and counts remain live when records are missing.
